			{
				"name": "ExplorerContent.anyExplorerScreen",
				"type": "markup",
				"description": "The one screen component the address selects, rendered with the whole host object spread onto it inside an hx-div with display: contents. The choice runs in order: route.screen (styles, translations, dependencies, permissions, modules or module-resources) first; then category 'platforms' gives the platforms screen; then, with no entity and no helper, category 'pages' gives the pages screen and any other category the catalog screen; then section 'details' gives the details screen, section 'history' the history screen, and any other section gets the overview for the kind, which is the matching entity's category or route.category when no entity matches."
			}
		],
